# AI workflow

This repo is worked on by multiple AI tools. Continuity lives in
`docs/AI_HANDOFF.md`.

- **Start every larger task by reading `docs/AI_HANDOFF.md`** (plus `AGENTS.md`
  and `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`).
- If a handoff exists, **do not restart from zero** — continue from
  "Next Recommended Steps".
- Before finishing, **update `docs/AI_HANDOFF.md`** with what changed, commands
  run, errors/blockers, decisions, and the next steps.
- Log new decisions in `docs/DECISIONS.md`; log new errors in
  `docs/ERRORS_AND_FIXES.md`; update `docs/OPEN_TASKS.md`.

Full workflow and copy-paste handoff prompts: `docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`.
